# ConvertHub

This folder is a **standalone project**, not the whole `Course` monorepo.

- **GitHub:** https://github.com/petrovicniikola-max/convert-hub
- **Owner:** petrovicniikola-max
- **Deploy:** Cloudflare Pages via Git push to `main`
- **Build:** `npm run build` → `dist/`
- **Node:** 22+

When changing canonical URLs, update all three: `astro.config.mjs` (`site`), `src/lib/seo.ts` (`SITE_URL`), `public/robots.txt` (Sitemap).

See `PROJECT.md` for Cloudflare build settings and MVP roadmap.
